# @hub-lanes

# ── UNBLOCK LANE (BH-7722, UNB-0) ───────────────────────────────────────────
# Every 10 minutes, offset 4 from dequeue-watch, bin/unblock.sh tick runs
# Tackler once per project whose mode is not off (bin/lib/unblock/scope.sh;
# today cromford, shadow). Kill
# switches first, then the collectors, the rules, a claim before any spend,
# and one ledger row per decision. With no collector wired a tick logs
# "0 collectors, 0 rows". A per-project lock (unb_scope_lock) dedupes; timeout 540.
# Off: unblock.enabled=0, flags/lane-off-unblock, staff-kill-tackler,
# flags/staff-off-tackler, or bin/harness-ctl.sh off unblock.
4-59/10 * * * * /root/harness/bin/hub-lease.sh check && /root/harness/bin/unblock.sh tick >/dev/null 2>&1
